*HEADING
ABSS example: single CPS4 element, J2 plasticity, load (10 increments) then partial unload (10 increments)
** Prescribed end displacement 0.05 (strain 0.005 = 4x first yield strain) in step LOAD, back to 0.015 in UNLOAD.
